All files carry $VERSION 0.502 (manifest target). CPAN currently indexes Langertha::Raider, Langertha::Raider::Result, Langertha::Raid* at 0.502 from Langertha-0.502, and the raw copies from core carried 0.504. A Langertha-Raider release at 0.502 is equal, not higher, so PAUSE will likely keep the index on Langertha-0.502 and `cpanm Langertha::Raider` would keep resolving to core. Decide the first version (>= 0.503, e.g. 0.504) before release; bump is one perl -pi over lib/ bin/. Langertha 0.503 must also be released first (cpanfile floor).

